      <div class="story__aside" aria-hidden="true">
        {{ icon("layers", "lg") }}
        <span class="story__rail"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="story__body">
        <p>Technology and SaaS companies operate across interconnected applications and cloud environments where security weaknesses can expose customer data and disrupt critical business operations. Frequent software releases and third-party integrations can introduce vulnerabilities across APIs and authentication systems while misconfigured cloud resources and inadequate access controls increase the risk of exploitation.</p>
        <p>CipherTrivia delivers cybersecurity services for technology and SaaS companies to identify security gaps across web applications and APIs alongside cloud infrastructure and software environments. Our security assessments combine vulnerability assessment and penetration testing (VAPT) with application security testing and configuration reviews to uncover exploitable weaknesses and evaluate their potential business impact.</p>
        <p>By prioritizing risks based on exploitability and severity, we help technology teams strengthen security controls and address vulnerabilities before they affect production environments. Our approach supports secure software development and SaaS platform protection while helping organizations maintain customer trust and build stronger security practices as their products scale.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

